---
title: Keep a copy
kind: automated
timeout: 120
---

Save what the next step replaces, so Rollback has something to restore.

```bash run
mkdir -p "$WORK_DIR"
touch "$WORK_DIR/last-run"
cp "$WORK_DIR/last-run" "$WORK_DIR/last-run.bak"
echo "saved $WORK_DIR/last-run.bak"
```

```text expect
saved {{any}}/last-run.bak
```
